{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"成唯識論校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"一.是書校歷三週．一譯校．二類校．三刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"二.譯校對勘頌文．凡用三種異本。（一）梵本．三十唯識頌．〈安慧釋牒文抄出〉（二）藏本．","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"勝友等譯三十論頌．（三）陳本．真諦譯轉識論牒文。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"三.譯校對勘凡有二例。（一）以梵文頌式格量奘譯．幷旁證轉識論．凡奘譯字句增","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"損顛倒可斷其爲改作者．悉註出曰．勘梵藏本雲雲．轉識論雲雲．今譯雲雲。（二）","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"三本異文疑係傳誦各別者．亦爲註出曰．梵藏本雲雲．轉識論雲雲。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"四.類校對勘長行．凡用五種異本。（一）梵本．安慧三十唯識釋．（二）藏本．勝友等譯","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"安慧三十論釋．〈前書譯本〉（三）藏本．勝友等譯律天三十論疏．〈前釋註疏〉（四）陳本．真","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"諦譯轉識論．（五）疏本．唐基師成唯識論述記。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"五.類校對勘凡有七例。（一）安慧釋頌章段．悉就頌文乙出．長行例知．不別加註．但","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"於每段生起異同悉爲註記。（二）奘譯糅雜安慧釋文者．悉爲註出曰．此句此段","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"糅安慧釋。（三）述記所傳安慧等說勘安慧釋互有同異者．亦爲註出曰．述記某","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"卷雲雲．勘安慧釋雲雲。（四）奘譯糅文多經潤飾．有處原意參差晦失者．亦爲註","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"出曰．勘安慧釋意或原釋雲雲。（五）安慧釋義奘譯未糅者．亦擇要註出曰．安慧","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"釋雲雲。以上各註皆參照律天之說寫定．文不別標。（六）轉識論爲安慧以前","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"之三十論舊釋．今亦對勘異同註出曰．此句此段同轉識論．或轉識論雲雲。（七）","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"長行章句無梵藏本可勘者．悉依述記刊定。其有廣釋別辨大段．亦參酌文義．悉","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"爲區分。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"六.刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對勘麗刻明刻及述記牒文．確審爲訛略者．乃改正附註","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"曰．原刻雲雲．今依某本雲雲。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"七.刊本款式．今略改動以醒眉目．其例如次。（一）頌文次第．逐頌記數。（二）長行大","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"段正釋頌文者頂格．廣釋別辨者低格。（三）文中分讀用小點．絕句用大點．斷段","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"用圈。（四）外人申難．用⊙分段。（五）各家異義．逐段旁註一*二*等。（六）引用","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"書名．旁標短線。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"八.本書校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"（一）梵本．三十唯識頌．Trim%s\\ika^vijn~aptika^rika^.","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"（二）梵本．三十唯識釋．Trim%s/ika^vijn~aptibha^s!ya.以上二種合本．Vijn~aptima^tra-","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"ta^siddhi,pp.13-45.法人萊維氏SylvainLe/vi校刊．一九二五年．巴黎版。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"（三）藏本．三十論頌．Sum-cu-pah!itshigleh!urbyas-pa.曲尼版丹珠．經解部.","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"c#i字函．一頁至三頁上。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"（四）藏本.三十論釋.Sum-cu-pah!ibc#ad-pa.曲尼版丹珠．經解部．c#i字函．一五","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"〇頁下至一七五頁下。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"（五）藏本．三十論疏．Sum-cu-pah!ih!grel-bc#ad.曲尼版丹珠．經解部．i字函．一","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"頁至五十六頁下。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"（六）陳本．轉識論．金陵刻經處刊本。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"（七）疏本．成唯識論述記．金陵刻經處刊本。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_191_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_191","text":"（八）本書南宋刻麗刻及明刻．悉依日本大正大藏經本之校註。","sortOrder":41}],"overrides":{}}